{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/u1wn2t8j","slide":9,"text":"public class PlayerRuntimeData : MonoBehaviour\n{\n    public static PlayerRuntimeData Instance { get; private set; }\n    public bool HasData { get; private set; }\n\n    public int maxHP, currentHP;\n    public int maxStamina, currentStamina;\n    public float attackDamage;\n\n    public void SaveFromPlayer(Player player, PlayerHealth health)\n    {\n        if (player == null || health == null) return;\n\n        maxHP = health.MaxHP;\n        currentHP = health.CurrentHP;\n        maxStamina = player.MaxStaminaInt;\n        currentStamina = player.CurrentStaminaInt;\n        attackDamage = player.attackDamage;\n        HasData = true;\n    }\n}","textPreview":"public class PlayerRuntimeData : MonoBehaviour | { |     public static PlayerRuntimeData Instance { get; private set; } |     public bool...","textChars":636,"textLines":21,"bbox":[96,242,656,360]}
